     board for it: the layout must give each LDO at least that board's copper, a Layer 10 means, read by T10-A5); the pre-regulator's top
     4.2907 V (the divider at 0.1 % and 25 ppm/K over 65 K, VFB's printed band and IFB: every tolerance at its worst); the controller's
     printed maxima at its own junction; the enabled set's bound; the circuit's auxiliaries at the full rail; the share fully used
     rev Y, the bounded state:                 0.2558 A, 125.2 C: margin -0.22 K = -1.1 mA at the LDO; lost at a local air of 76.23 C, or at 183 C/W in place of 184;
       at the LDO's top output (the controller's current up 1.5 %, MODEL; the drop smaller) it reads 121.2 C, under the corner above
